Selphi 2 — third-party attributions
====================================

This product includes software components derived from, or that
reimplement algorithms from, the following open-source projects.


GLIMPSE2
--------
Selphi 2's low-coverage sequencing engine (the `sparse_ls` module and the
low-coverage founder phasing HMM in `lcwgs/phasing_hmm.rs`) is a faithful
reimplementation of the GLIMPSE2 imputation/phasing model.

    GLIMPSE2 — Rubinacci S, Delaneau O, et al.
